{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/t07.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/t07.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "t07_01",
      "hash64": "E7D193C3C4005204",
      "text": "歡迎來到採掘之鎮――穴扎鎮。\\n這裡有許多勤奮工作的人。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "t07_06",
      "hash64": "E7D192C3C4005051",
      "text": "在都會觀光當然很好玩，\\n但像這樣樸實的城鎮也是別有風情啊～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "t07_07",
      "hash64": "E7D191C3C4004E9E",
      "text": "所謂的穴扎就是挖洞的意思。\\c\\n如同鎮名一樣，\\n多數的居民都以採掘維生。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "t07_09",
      "hash64": "E7D18BC3C400446C",
      "text": "椅子的可貴之處……！\\n等[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳長大了就會明白的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t07_11",
      "hash64": "E7CE0FC3C3FD3BE1",
      "text": "我在採掘場看到了\\n大得像座山的寶可夢喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t07_12",
      "hash64": "E7CE0CC3C3FD36C8",
      "text": "我也看到了像條河川一樣\\n長長的寶可夢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t07_16",
      "hash64": "E7CE10C3C3FD3D94",
      "text": "小小象是地面屬性！\\n電屬性拿牠沒轍，毒屬性也不是牠的對手！\\r\\n……但不要對牠潑水喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t07_31",
      "hash64": "E7C783C3C3F7E24F",
      "text": "下班回家的路上，\\n我會和夥伴在那個對戰場打寶可夢對戰。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t07_36",
      "hash64": "E7C780C3C3F7DD36",
      "text": "因為有大炭車在，\\n我才能努力工作。\\c\\n……牠不只在費力的工作上幫我，\\n同時牠也是我的精神支柱。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t07_42",
      "hash64": "E7C3FEC3C3F4CA79",
      "text": "我在鎮外快要倒下的時候，\\n是一位野生的寶可夢中心\\r\\n大姐姐救了我。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t07_taxi",
      "hash64": "14FCCC1A9AE56123",
      "text": "怒鸚哥幫忙載送的空中之旅！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳平時有在使用飛翔計程車嗎？\\c\\n只要[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳從地圖App叫車，\\n不論哪裡我們都會飛奔前往。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
